{
  "format": "babizu-playground-project",
  "version": 1,
  "title": {
    "zh-TW": "巴宰語與噶哈巫語（範例專案）",
    "en": "Pazeh and Kaxabu (sample project)"
  },
  "description": {
    "zh-TW": "從《巴宰語詞典》（李壬癸與土田滋）、《噶哈巫語分類辭典》（潘永歷）、《噶哈巫語參考語法》（林鴻瑞）選出的幾十個詞與例句，以及一些音變規則與較能產的常用詞綴。用來展示 babizu 相關功能，展示如何編輯規則與條目。",
    "en": "A few dozen words and example sentences selected from the Pazeh Dictionary (Li and Tsuchida), Kaxabu Classification Dictionary (Pan Ing-Lek), and Kaxabu Reference Grammar (Lim Hong-Sui 2023), as well as some phonological rules and commonly used affixes. This project is used to demonstrate the functions of babizu and how to edit rules and entries."
  },
